      ],
      "text": "Azathioprine:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " aminosalicylates (ex, sulfasalazine · mesalamine) inhibit TPMT in vitro, so combine w caution; ACEis have been reported to induce anemia & severe leukopenia; it may inhibit warfarin's anticoag effect"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
