     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Azathioprine:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " CBC w PLT wkly during the first mo, twice monthly for the second & third mo, then monthly (or more often w dose chgs)"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "TPMT or NUDT15 deficiency may ↑risk of severe, life-threatening myelotoxicity w conventional doses; consider alt therapy if homozygous deficient & ↓doses if heterozygous"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Tell pts about the malig risk (lymphoma & other CAs, particularly of the skin) & to limit sun & UV exposure; it can cause fetal harm, so ⍉it in preg whenever poss"
     }
    ]
   }
